     "note_no_host": "--no-host is REQUIRED whenever a CPU_REPACK path is under test. Without it make_cpu_buft_list() puts the device host buffer type ahead of the CPU extra buffer types and the repack path never engages, so both A/B arms silently test the same code."
   }
 }
